^SAMPLE = GSM4670418
!Sample_title = Brain CD45+ cells, Cd300a-fl/fl, naïve
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM4670418
!Sample_status = Public on Dec 22 2021
!Sample_submission_date = Jul 14 2020
!Sample_last_update_date = Jul 02 2026
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Brain CD45+ cells
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: Brain CD45+ cells
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = strain: C57BL/6
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: Cd300a-fl/fl
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Transient cerebral ischemia (MCAO) was induced using the intraluminal filament technique. A silicon-coated nylon monofilament (Doccol Corporation) was inserted into the right internal carotid artery and left in situ for 60 min. Operation time per animal did not exceed 15 min. During the MCAO procedure, mice were kept on the 40°C heater and after 60 min, the inserted monofilament was withdrawn to allow reperfusion. We only included mice that showed reduction of blood flow of right middle cerebral artery which confirmed by doppler ultrasound.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = To isolate the brain cells, mice were sedated under deep anesthesia and perfused with PBS transcardially. Collected brain tissues were transferred to dounce homogenizer with 3.5ml of RPMI-1640 and grinded using loose and tight plunger. Homogenates were filtered through 70 micrometre cell strainer and then subjected to Percoll (GE Healthcare) gradient centrifugation. Cells were collected from the interlayer between 40% and 70% Percoll layers. Collected cells were filtered through 70 micrometre nylon mesh to obtain single-cell suspensions and PI-CD45+ hematopoietic cells were sorted by flow cytometry.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = 10X Genomics, Chromium Single Cell 3’ Library and Gel Bead Kit v3.
!Sample_data_processing = Read alignment and estimation of cell-containing partitions and associated UMIs using Cell Ranger 3.0.2.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: mtx: count matrix in sparse matrix format; barcodes.tsv: barcode ids per sample; genes.tsv: gene ids per sample
!Sample_platform_id = GPL21273
